# Sales & Revenue Analysis Dashboard

## Overview
This project focuses on analyzing sales and revenue data using an interactive dashboard. The dashboard helps track business performance and generate useful insights through data visualization.

---

## Key Features
- Import data from Excel, CSV, or database sources
- Track KPIs such as:
  - Total Sales
  - Total Revenue
  - Revenue Trends
  - Top-Performing Products
- Use charts, filters, and slicers for interactive analysis
- Generate business insights from sales data

---

## Tools Used
- Power BI
- Microsoft Excel
- CSV Dataset

